    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, you may use <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> to calm Hostile and Unfriendly <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Beasts\" title=\"Beasts\">Beasts</a>. Make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> check; if the result equals or exceeds the targets' <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>, its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attitude\">Attitude</a> immediately shifts to Indifferent. You can affect a number of creatures whose total combined levels do not exceed your Character Level. This is a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mind-Affecting\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind-Affecting\">Mind-Affecting</a> effect.",
